#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# bit_clear

#% text
# `bit_clear(k, i)` gives the integer k with bit i (0 the least significant) set to 0.

#% section
# Details

#% item
# Negative integers count in two's complement, as for `bit_and`. Lists thread over k.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
bit_clear(63, 0)
#% output
#= 62

#% cell
bit_clear(63, 3)
#% output
#= 55

#% cell
bit_clear(-1, 4)
#% output
#= -17

#% cell
bit_clear(bit_set(11, 2), 2)
#% output
#= 11

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `bit_set`, `bit_flip`, `bit_and`
